{
  "name": "DineLine 04 \u00b7 Customer Notifications (SMS / WhatsApp)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 04 \u00b7 Customer notifications\nThe app posts every customer text here: order confirmations, ready / out for delivery updates, booking confirmations and cancellations.\n\n1. Set appUrl, secret and twilioFrom in **Config**.\n2. Pick your Twilio credential on both Twilio nodes.\n3. Activate and set the Production URL as `N8N_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK_URL` in `.env.local`.\n4. Set `TWILIO_CHANNEL=whatsapp` in the app to use WhatsApp.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "881ca28e-f481-4364-82f2-f9cfaad26f44",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "dineline-notify",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e730424c-1580-4300-87ad-deb95c7094f6",
      "name": "From DineLine app",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "689216ff-8711-4d2a-9c08-fddeb8fd01e1"
    },
    {
